# Keeps the Docker build context small and ensures no secret or local state is ever copied into an
# image layer. Only the .NET source needed to publish DBAIAzure.Web should reach the build stage.

# Build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
publish/

# Version control & editor/tooling metadata
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.forge/

# Spec tree, docs, and tests — not needed to build the runtime image
specs/
src/DBAIAzure.Web/specs/
tests/
**/*.md

# Local databases — ephemeral demo state must never be baked into the image
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# Secrets — never copy any env file into the build context (Article IX)
**/team.env
**/*.env
!**/*.env.example

# Misc
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
